    \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0431\u0438\u0442\u0442\u044F \u0432\u0435\u0436\u0456) =
    \u0448\u043A\u043E\u0434\u0430, \u044F\u043A\u0443 \u043E\u0442\u0440\u0438\u043C\u0430\u0454
    \u0432\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0433  "
  - 'The "Rail" is effective against armored and resilient enemies.  \n\nEnemies
    of the "HEAVY" type have 50% armor, meaning 50% of the damage will be ignored
    if the tower doesn''t have piercing.  \n\nFor example, the "Rail T1" has 30%
    piercing. If the tower shoots at a "HEAVY" type enemy, only 20% of the damage
    will be ignored.  \n\nFORMULA: 100% - (enemy armor - tower piercing) = damage
    received by the enemy'
  _updateInEditor: 0
